    "detailed_description": "Fight against the hordes of alebrijes, colorful creatures born in the nightmares of Mexican artist Pedro Linares L\u00f3pez.<br>Use the power of Mexican cuisine to defeat your enemies, while focusing on side-steping and dodging incoming attacks.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720420/extras/650f6d97be57c490456e353b8f561704.poster.avif?t=1754622327\" width=600 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720420/extras/650f6d97be57c490456e353b8f561704.webm?t=1754622327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720420/extras/650f6d97be57c490456e353b8f561704.mp4?t=1754622327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Collect gold to purchase items and add them to the offering, increasing your powers and abilities.<br>Merge, rotate and organize your inventory to fit as many items as possible!<br>Strike a balance between power and economy. Can you covet one more round or will you be trampled?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720420/extras/eae6457d54fd97e3e54c391d2d347b26.poster.avif?t=1754622327\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720420/extras/eae6457d54fd97e3e54c391d2d347b26.webm?t=1754622327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720420/extras/eae6457d54fd97e3e54c391d2d347b26.mp4?t=1754622327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
